WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.523
The same 20 questions on 47 different forms.

00:00:03.523 --> 00:00:04.828
ats-fill is a free,

00:00:04.828 --> 00:00:10.735
local-first Chrome extension that fills job applications from a profile you save once,

00:00:10.735 --> 00:00:12.796
then tracks every application.

00:00:12.796 --> 00:00:14.651
Here is everything it does.

00:00:15.867 --> 00:00:16.605
Chapter one.

00:00:16.605 --> 00:00:18.143
Your profile, saved once.

00:00:19.967 --> 00:00:21.676
Upload your resume once.

00:00:21.676 --> 00:00:23.456
PDF, DOCX or pasted text.

00:00:23.456 --> 00:00:24.596
Contact details,

00:00:24.596 --> 00:00:28.727
work history and standard answers like work authorization,

00:00:28.727 --> 00:00:32.145
start date and salary range are saved in Chrome,

00:00:32.145 --> 00:00:33.214
on your device.

00:00:34.314 --> 00:00:35.691
Memory you can audit.

00:00:35.691 --> 00:00:38.905
Answers you correct on real forms are remembered.

00:00:38.905 --> 00:00:41.528
Review, edit, ignore or delete each one.

00:00:41.528 --> 00:00:45.201
Sensitive demographic fields stay off unless you opt in.

00:00:46.567 --> 00:00:47.280
Chapter two.

00:00:47.280 --> 00:00:48.706
Fill a real application.

00:00:50.667 --> 00:00:52.140
Land on an application.

00:00:52.140 --> 00:00:56.239
Greenhouse, Lever, Ashby and Workday are detected automatically.

00:00:56.239 --> 00:00:59.954
ats-fill reads the job description straight from the page.

00:01:02.817 --> 00:01:03.745
Open ats-fill.

00:01:03.745 --> 00:01:06.329
The home screen shows the detected ATS,

00:01:06.329 --> 00:01:07.655
whether your resume,

00:01:07.655 --> 00:01:09.577
profile and memory are ready,

00:01:09.577 --> 00:01:11.367
and how the last fill went.

00:01:15.317 --> 00:01:17.186
Review before anything is typed.

00:01:17.186 --> 00:01:21.276
Preview every answer it will use, search them, and fix anything first.

00:01:21.276 --> 00:01:24.315
Questions it cannot answer are flagged, not guessed.

00:01:27.817 --> 00:01:28.854
Filled in place.

00:01:28.854 --> 00:01:29.956
You press submit.

00:01:29.956 --> 00:01:32.355
Fields are filled on the page itself.

00:01:32.355 --> 00:01:33.198
File uploads,

00:01:33.198 --> 00:01:38.710
attestations and the submit button stay yours: ats-fill never submits an application.

00:01:40.067 --> 00:01:41.004
Chapter three.

00:01:41.004 --> 00:01:42.946
Search 16 job boards at once.

00:01:44.234 --> 00:01:45.979
One search box, 16 boards.

00:01:45.979 --> 00:01:48.665
Nine keyless boards work out of the box,

00:01:48.665 --> 00:01:49.941
including Remotive,

00:01:49.941 --> 00:01:52.425
We Work Remotely and HN Who's Hiring.

00:01:52.425 --> 00:01:55.245
Toggle any source on or off with its chip.

00:01:56.884 --> 00:01:58.788
Deduped results, ready to save.

00:01:58.788 --> 00:02:02.413
Each card shows pay, location and a source-confidence hint.

00:02:02.413 --> 00:02:06.776
One click saves the job to your pipeline with its description attached.

00:02:09.384 --> 00:02:10.774
Filter before you read.

00:02:10.774 --> 00:02:11.801
Narrow by remote,

00:02:11.801 --> 00:02:13.433
employment type and region,

00:02:13.433 --> 00:02:14.400
set a pay range,

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:17.483
and hide listings that don't publish salary at all.

00:02:21.884 --> 00:02:23.407
Bring your own boards.

00:02:23.407 --> 00:02:24.793
Add keys for Adzuna,

00:02:24.793 --> 00:02:25.347
USAJOBS,

00:02:25.347 --> 00:02:26.455
Reed and Jooble,

00:02:26.455 --> 00:02:29.294
or any RSS feed: a state workforce board,

00:02:29.294 --> 00:02:30.541
a niche community,

00:02:30.541 --> 00:02:32.273
an internal careers page.

00:02:34.133 --> 00:02:34.930
Chapter four.

00:02:34.930 --> 00:02:36.401
Track every application.

00:02:38.233 --> 00:02:40.355
Every application on one board.

00:02:40.355 --> 00:02:42.819
Drafts, submitted, interview, offer.

00:02:42.819 --> 00:02:45.968
Jobs you fill or save land here automatically.

00:02:45.968 --> 00:02:48.637
Import or export CSV whenever you like.

00:02:50.883 --> 00:02:52.377
Verdicts and scorecards.

00:02:52.377 --> 00:02:54.120
Each job keeps its pay band,

00:02:54.120 --> 00:02:54.680
location,

00:02:54.680 --> 00:02:55.054
notes,

00:02:55.054 --> 00:02:56.423
verdict and scorecard,

00:02:56.423 --> 00:02:59.971
so you remember why you applied when the recruiter calls.

00:03:03.383 --> 00:03:05.140
Capture any job in seconds.

00:03:05.140 --> 00:03:08.785
Save the job on the current tab, or paste a description.

00:03:08.785 --> 00:03:13.014
With a Gemini key, clean up or summarize the JD before saving it.

00:03:15.883 --> 00:03:16.698
Light or dark.

00:03:16.698 --> 00:03:20.596
Follows your system theme, for late-night application sessions too.

00:03:22.633 --> 00:03:23.323
Chapter five.

00:03:23.323 --> 00:03:24.701
Prepare for the interview.

00:03:26.733 --> 00:03:28.561
Questions from the actual JD.

00:03:28.561 --> 00:03:33.981
Interview Prep turns a saved job's description and your profile into likely questions,

00:03:33.981 --> 00:03:36.439
each with a suggested answer structure.

00:03:39.383 --> 00:03:41.613
Draft answers next to each question.

00:03:41.613 --> 00:03:44.152
Write STAR stories against each question.

00:03:44.152 --> 00:03:47.867
Answers are saved locally per job, ready for the next round.

00:03:51.633 --> 00:03:52.283
Chapter six.

00:03:52.283 --> 00:03:53.420
Learn what's working.

00:03:55.733 --> 00:03:57.197
Response rate by source.

00:03:57.197 --> 00:03:59.758
See which boards actually lead to replies,

00:03:59.758 --> 00:04:01.099
not just applications,

00:04:01.099 --> 00:04:03.538
computed locally from your own pipeline.

00:04:07.383 --> 00:04:09.047
Pay bands and response time.

00:04:09.047 --> 00:04:10.949
Which salary ranges get answers,

00:04:10.949 --> 00:04:13.088
and how long employers usually take,

00:04:13.088 --> 00:04:14.870
so you know when to follow up.

00:04:19.633 --> 00:04:20.549
Chapter seven.

00:04:20.549 --> 00:04:21.726
Private by design.

00:04:23.733 --> 00:04:26.083
AI is optional and uses your own key.

00:04:26.083 --> 00:04:31.608
Gemini powers resume parsing, answer drafting and interview prep with a key you supply.

00:04:31.608 --> 00:04:34.974
Fill, tracking, search and analytics work without it.

00:04:36.383 --> 00:04:37.949
Your data, your controls.

00:04:37.949 --> 00:04:40.643
Everything stays in Chrome's local storage.

00:04:40.643 --> 00:04:44.777
Export to CSV, clear the cache, or delete everything in one click.

00:04:48.633 --> 00:04:50.207
Add ats-fill to Chrome.

00:04:50.207 --> 00:04:52.055
Free and open source (MIT).

00:04:52.055 --> 00:04:54.725
No server, no account, no subscription.

00:04:54.725 --> 00:04:57.462
You review every field and press submit.
